# Contact Form & Meeting Booking - Walkthrough

## What Was Implemented

### 1. Enhanced Contact Form with Toast Notifications
- Professional floating toast notification that slides in from the right
- Success state: "Thank you! We will contact you shortly."
- Error state with fallback message
- Auto-dismisses after 5 seconds with close button

### 2. Book a Meeting Section
Beautiful new section below the contact form featuring:
- Gradient background with glassmorphism effects
- Feature badges: "Google Meet video call", "Auto-syncs to calendars", "Pick your preferred time"
- Prominent "Schedule a Call" button with "Free" badge
- 30-minute consultation description

![Book a Meeting Section](contact_section_full_1768915895210.png)

